    "integration_changes": [
      "Native parser and ActiveILCreater are the active PDF entry path; document-local font cache and cancellable Type3 parsing ported to both IR frontends.",
      "PyMuPDF 2 native ruled-table recognition uses use_layout=False; no duplicate OCR/layout model.",
      "Explicit close of PDF handles before Windows worker cleanup.",
      "Native CMaps share one verified, size-bounded resource loader with the legacy parser.",
      "Checkpoint generation switches archive old paragraphs, contexts and review metadata transactionally; parser-version fingerprint prevents positional reuse across incompatible IR."
    ],
